  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A 20-ft-radius Sphere of inky fog (magical Darkness) within 120 ft. Each creature in it when it appears, entering it, or ending its turn there makes a WIS save (once per turn): 5d6 Psychic damage and it subtracts 1d6 from its saving throws until the end of its next turn on a failure, half damage only on a success. At the start of each of your turns, move the Sphere 10 ft away from you. A strong wind disperses it.</p>",
